      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……虽然，我想您应该已经知道了吧。\n我从出生开始，身体就非常脆弱，非常容易受伤……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aa77f93dfccaf9cc2e0343d95744a526967af49893eed767c05ddefc4a738a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
