        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58d788037998a9940ad6ccf1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实，我本来应该还有一位双胞胎姐妹——但是，她却没能顺利降生。\n已经失去了她，不能连我也一并失去……\n为此，我的父母付出了相当的努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62bf7bd3e26e16c6c77be86f0a77018e9fc9ae49827b81a902a83c1d7cef8f27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1071/storytimeline_041071004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5db7ff008995225417feb4e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1071/storytimeline_041071004.json",
